## 🛠️ Troubleshooting

| Error | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `vai_q_onnx not found` | You are outside the Docker container — run `bash docker_launch.sh` |
| `No DPU subgraph found` | Recompile with correct `KV260_arch.json` from Vitis-AI installation |
| `vart not found` on board | Run `source /etc/profile.d/pynq_venv.sh` then retry |
| OOM on KV260 | Add `low_cpu_mem_usage=True` to `from_pretrained()`; use 256M model |
| OpenCV window blank | Run `export DISPLAY=:0` before launching live test |
| SSH drops during `scp` | Add `ServerAliveInterval 30` to `~/.ssh/config` |
| Low accuracy after INT8 | Increase calibration images to 300+; ensure domain matches OCRBench |
| ONNX export `TracerWarning` | Wrap model in `torch.no_grad()`; remove Python-side control flow |

